---
size: 80x24
theme: "mono"
data:
  - x: 1
    y: 10
  - x: 2
    y: 20
---
[ frontmatter above exercises: fence, key, number, quoted string, list dash ]

[- bordered node with leading+trailing alignment dashes -]
( borderless node )

[ A ] -> [ B ]
[ C ] <- [ D ]
[ E ] <-> [ F ]
[ G ] --> [ H ]
[ I ] <--> [ J ]
[ K ] ---> [ L ]

[ src ] -- ( friend ) --> [ dst ]

[- declare me :: alpha -]
[- point back   &alpha -]

[- chart body @series1 | bar -]
[- chart body @series1 | hbar -]
[- chart body @series1 | vbar -]

[ contact user@example.com stays literal, no data ref ]
